# GMLAN low-speed (single-wire) bench example: wake the bus, then keep it awake.
#
# 1. One high-voltage wake-up frame (ID 100, no data, sent with the J2534 SW_CAN_HV_TX flag).
# 2. Functional TesterPresent (ID 101, data FE 01 3E) every 2 seconds, 10 times.
#
# Check these against your own captures before using them on a vehicle.

bus LS

send 100 hv          # high-voltage wake-up
wait 100

repeat 10
    send 101 FE 01 3E    # all nodes, 1 byte, TesterPresent
    wait 2000
end
